      "statement": "Piyush Goyal, India's Commerce and Industry Minister, is leading a business delegation to Japan to discuss ways to boost trade and investment ties.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "India and Canada reaffirm their commitment to finalize a Bilateral Investment Treaty and conclude trade negotiations by the end of 2026.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "India faces a critical energy crisis due to increased crude supply from Russia and West Asia, which are under threat as global markets struggle with supply disruptions.",
